The largest category in the definition is the infraorder simian <
http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simian >. So I'd argue it's invalid to assume
it's more restrictive than that.

It has been proposed that {smani} be used for the order primates <
http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=mabru+klejutsi&bl=y >

